      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْوَقُ</span></b>  A penis (TA) <i>having a large glans;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَوَّقٌ</span></b> . (K, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْشَلَةٌ حَوْقَآءُ</span> (K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمَرَةٌ حَوْقَآءُ</span> (TA.) <i>A large</i> (K, TA) <i>and
prominent</i> (TA) <i>glans of a penis.</i> (K, TA.)

